:"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T16:36:20-08:00","id":1500969,"title":"","content":"This is great. The concept makes my brain start screaming though. Size 4?!? I can\u2019t stand normal spiders, much less ones almost as big as me, and also can cast spells. I can just image the horror from one of Spell Weavers picking up some Mind or Life, and mind/body controlling things for food. At that size they would need hefty amounts of food just to get by\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T17:09:10-08:00","id":1500977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1463451-monster-mash-2021-round-7?p=1500969#post1500969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is great. The concept makes my brain start screaming though. Size 4?!? I can\u2019t stand normal spiders, much less ones almost as big as me, and also can cast spells. I can just image the horror from one of Spell Weavers picking up some Mind or Life, and mind/body controlling things for food. At that size they would need hefty amounts of food just to get by\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Over on the Occultist Anonymous Discord, the point was raised that they'd be pretty freaky as normal-sized spiders, too since they could hide just about anywhere and have access to magic. So that's worth thinking about too. <br /> <br /> Since they mostly live in Emmenations Realms, I'm assuming that food isn't a problem... they probably aren't the only magical bullshit around there. The ones in the mortal realms though... yeah, they probably eat people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T17:59:37-08:00","id":1500984,"title":"","content":"This is a great monster, I can see them as both disturbing allies or terrifying enemies. Spiders of size 4 are still within the realm of what a default spell can affect. So long as they don't learn certain Space or Life spells, then they shouldn't alter their size into more worrisome proportions<br /> <br /> <img width=\"600\" height=\"839\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a8/0d/94/a80d94ced52c9cc91b6aef873d116143.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a8/0d/94/a80d94ced52c9cc91b6aef873d116143.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a8/0d/94/a80d94ced52c9cc91b6aef873d116143.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Then again, they only have Medicine 1, so they probably don't have the best intrinsic grasp of human anatomy, I imagine their attempts to use Life to masquerade as humans would be....off the mark<br /> <br /> <img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/40efc8aa-012e-44ee-9b1d-a150972c569a/ddw4f8s-69a9107a-1c20-4eaa-9a33-8d4515a57f4e.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI